+ * ESP32_PERIPH_CPU_CPU1       25 0x168   0x27c
+ * ESP32_PERIPH_CPU_CPU2       26 0x16c   0x280
+ * ESP32_PERIPH_CPU_CPU3       27 0x170   0x284
